The code in src/scene/ocean/ is ported to TypeScript from Poseidon
(https://github.com/owenyuwono/poseidon, commit
671053b812fcbffe8ecc4668eaa6ab7ffeb63287) and modified for 3D Clip Studio:
per-instance state, an injectable atmosphere sky, deterministic foam reset,
TAA velocity and disposal. Poseidon adapts its spectrum and FFT techniques
from gasgiant/FFT-Ocean (https://github.com/gasgiant/FFT-Ocean, MIT), based on
Tessendorf 2001 and Horvath 2015; water optics use the Jerlov tables of
Solonenko & Mobley 2015. No Poseidon assets (sky panoramas) are included.

